message: "If you use IVB or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "IVB: India on Vande Bharat"
abstract: >-
  A planner for journeys and circuits across India on Vande Bharat trains
  alone, with an open dataset of the network: stations, routes, halts and
  timetables, also published as a GTFS feed. The code is released under the
  MIT licence and the data under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
